{"results":[{"id":"4869","type":"page","status":"current","title":"Apache Geronimo Development Process","position":-1,"body":{"storage":{"value":"<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"unmigrated-inline-wiki-markup\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"09aac7c9-a350-4dd0-9e48-6216a92508bf\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[{scrollbar}]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>\n<p>This section describes in detail the inner workings of the Geronimo project. Here you will find information about the open source community and the Apache Software Foundation (ASF), how the Geronimo project is managed, the different players involed in making Geronimo and last, but not least, how you can contribute to this project.</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Open Source Community overview\" /></ac:link>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><ac:link ac:anchor=\"About Apache Software Foundation (ASF)\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Open Source Community overview\" /><ac:link-body>About Apache Software Foundation (ASF)</ac:link-body></ac:link></li>\n\t\t<li><ac:link ac:anchor=\"Technology Compatibility Kit (TCK)\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Open Source Community overview\" /><ac:link-body>Technology Compatibility Kit (TCK)</ac:link-body></ac:link></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Release Manager Checklist\" /></ac:link>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><ac:link ac:anchor=\"Release Manager checklist\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Release Manager Checklist\" /><ac:link-body>Release Manager checklist</ac:link-body></ac:link></li>\n\t\t<li><ac:link ac:anchor=\"Release Manager Process\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Release Manager Checklist\" /><ac:link-body>Release Manager Process</ac:link-body></ac:link></li>\n\t\t<li><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Geronimo Component Release Process\" /></ac:link></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Contributor process\" /></ac:link>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><ac:link ac:anchor=\"How to get involved\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Contributor process\" /><ac:link-body>How to get involved</ac:link-body></ac:link></li>\n\t\t<li><ac:link ac:anchor=\"Roadmap - where do I fit?\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Contributor process\" /><ac:link-body>Roadmap - where do I fit?</ac:link-body></ac:link></li>\n\t\t<li><ac:link ac:anchor=\"Geronimo V1.0 Unassigned\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Contributor process\" /><ac:link-body>Geronimo V1.0 Unassigned defects</ac:link-body></ac:link></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Geronimo - What folks are working on\" /></ac:link></li>\n\t<li><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Merge etiquette\" /></ac:link></li>\n</ol>\n","representation":"storage","_expandable":{"content":"/rest/api/content/4869"}},"_expandable":{"editor":"","view":"","export_view":"","styled_view":"","anonymous_export_view":""}},"extensions":{"position":"none"},"_links":{"webui":"/spaces/GMOxPMGT/pages/4869/Apache+Geronimo+Development+Process","edit":"/pages/resumedraft.action?draftId=4869","tinyui":"/x/BRM","self":"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/rest/api/content/4869"},"_expandable":{"container":"/rest/api/space/GMOxPMGT","metadata":"","operations":"","children":"/rest/api/content/4869/child","restrictions":"/rest/api/content/4869/restriction/byOperation","history":"/rest/api/content/4869/history","ancestors":"","version":"","descendants":"/rest/api/content/4869/descendant","space":"/rest/api/space/GMOxPMGT","relevantViewRestrictions":"/rest/api/content/4869/restriction/relevantViewRestrictions"}},{"id":"4870","type":"page","status":"current","title":"Documentation","position":-1,"body":{"storage":{"value":"<ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"33c6e772-1b6e-420b-a7d7-2bc507ceaf8a\" ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"depth\">3</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>","representation":"storage","_expandable":{"content":"/rest/api/content/4870"}},"_expandable":{"editor":"","view":"","export_view":"","styled_view":"","anony